{"id":"93c6dd137bf8628e","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-finite-limits.md","title":"Definition — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子","display":"Definition — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-finite-limits"],"display":"Definition — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子","source_ref":"Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.2, pp.29–31","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.2, pp.29–31"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>，预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,R\">\\(P,Q,R\\)</span> 及自然变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:P\\to R\">\\(f:P\\to R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:Q\\to R\">\\(g:Q\\to R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:P\\to Q\">\\(a,b:P\\to Q\\)</span>。预层及自然性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 中的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{*\\}\">\\(\\{*\\}\\)</span> 是固定单元素集。以下对象赋值和箭头赋值共同定义预层。</p>\n<p>对每对预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span>，所选积对象为下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\times Q\">\\(P\\times Q\\)</span>，所选投影为下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q}\">\\(p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q}\\)</span>。后续的配对和箭头积采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a> 在此投影选择下定义的函数；投影自然变换及其集合分量均带完整源靶标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1(C)=\\{*\\},\\qquad 1(u)(*)=*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1(C)=\\{*\\},\\qquad 1(u)(*)=*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(P\\times Q)(C)=P(C)\\times Q(C),\\qquad (P\\times Q)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(P\\times Q)(C)=P(C)\\times Q(C),\\qquad (P\\times Q)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,P,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),P(C),((x,y)\\mapsto x))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,P,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),P(C),((x,y)\\mapsto x))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,Q,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),Q(C),((x,y)\\mapsto y))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,Q,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),Q(C),((x,y)\\mapsto y))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsProduct}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(P\\times Q,p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q},P,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsProduct}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(P\\times Q,p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q},P,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(P\\times_RQ)(C)=\\{(x,y)\\in P(C)\\times Q(C)\\mid f_C(x)=g_C(y)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(P\\times_RQ)(C)=\\{(x,y)\\in P(C)\\times Q(C)\\mid f_C(x)=g_C(y)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(P\\times_RQ)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(P\\times_RQ)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(C)=\\{x\\in P(C)\\mid a_C(x)=b_C(x)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(u)(x)=P(u)x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(C)=\\{x\\in P(C)\\mid a_C(x)=b_C(x)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(u)(x)=P(u)x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>拉回和等化子的限制映射落在指定子集中，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,a,b\">\\(f,g,a,b\\)</span> 的自然性保证；恒等与复合律来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span>。投影和包含映射逐点给出。任意锥逐点唯一诱导集合映射，唯一性又迫使这些集合映射满足自然性，因此它们确实实现各自的范畴泛性质。这里具体给出全部有限极限所需的基本构造。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.2, pp.29–31。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴 $\\mathcal C$，预层 $P,Q,R$ 及自然变换 $f:P\\to R$、$g:Q\\to R$、$a,b:P\\to Q$。预层及自然性见 [[14-df-presheaf-category]]；$u:D\\to C$ 表示 $\\mathcal C$ 中的箭头。$\\{*\\}$ 是固定单元素集。以下对象赋值和箭头赋值共同定义预层。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每对预层 $P,Q$，所选积对象为下式的 $P\\times Q$，所选投影为下式的 $p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q}$。后续的配对和箭头积采用 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]] 在此投影选择下定义的函数；投影自然变换及其集合分量均带完整源靶标签。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q,R","display":false},{"tex":"f:P\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"g:Q\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"P\\times Q","display":false},{"tex":"p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q}","display":false},{"tex":"1(C)=\\{*\\},\\qquad 1(u)(*)=*.","display":true},{"tex":"(P\\times Q)(C)=P(C)\\times Q(C),\\qquad (P\\times Q)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).","display":true},{"tex":"p_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,P,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),P(C),((x,y)\\mapsto x))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"q_{P,Q}\\coloneqq\\left(P\\times Q,Q,\\left((P(C)\\times Q(C),Q(C),((x,y)\\mapsto y))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsProduct}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(P\\times Q,p_{P,Q},q_{P,Q},P,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"(P\\times_RQ)(C)=\\{(x,y)\\in P(C)\\times Q(C)\\mid f_C(x)=g_C(y)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"(P\\times_RQ)(u)(x,y)=(P(u)x,Q(u)y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(C)=\\{x\\in P(C)\\mid a_C(x)=b_C(x)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Eq}(a,b)(u)(x)=P(u)x.","display":true},{"tex":"f,g,a,b","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false}],"bytes":2580,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits|df-186 — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子]]"},{"id":"10d7b3d339017c15","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点。$F$ 为层，$A\\subseteq F$ 为子层，以逐点子集及从 $F$ 继承的限制表示。$g:D\\to C$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 箭头，$t_C$ 与 $g^*$ 采用 [[14-df-closed-sieve]] 的记号。$1$ 是 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取单点集 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。集合箭头编码为 $(B,B',h)$，自然变换编码为 $(P,Q,\\alpha)$，其中 $\\alpha$ 是分量族；见 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]。下列 $\\Omega_J,t_J,\\chi_A^J$ 为新构造。"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"a56025295f88eafd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1782799288dd0ec","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits|df-186 — 预层的终对象、积、拉回与等化子]]"},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca489e8e614e025a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$，$i:\\mathcal E\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 为满包含。选取满足 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]] 的 $\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$ 的数据；$y$ 是 [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]] 的 Yoneda 函子，Yoneda 对应采用 [[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]。层的有限积采用逐点积，终层逐点为固定单元素集；这是 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 的构造在层上的限制。"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","1044b7940aaa4f1f"]}